---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import GlowLineSeparator from '@/components/ui/separator/GlowLineSeparator.astro';
const pageTitle = 'About Me';
const pageDescription = 'Learn more about my background and approach to AI Engineering.';
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} pubDate={new Date()} showHeader={false}>
  <p>
    I'm an AI Engineer from the Dominican Republic with an MSc in Artificial Intelligence and a background that spans data analysis,
    LLM systems, and full-stack development. What draws me to AI is something deeper than the tools.
    I'm genuinely fascinated by the biological nature of intelligence and what it means to replicate it in machines.
  </p>
  <p>
    I build things that make people's lives easier. That's the thread connecting everything I work on,
    from an agentic compliance engine that automates complex legal decisions to an ETL pipeline that turns thousands of
    scanned documents into structured, queryable data. I care about systems that are reliable, explainable and actually
    useful to the people who depend on them.
  </p>
  <p>
    When I'm not building, I'm the lead pianist at my local church, which has taught me more about listening,
    timing and showing up consistently than any engineering book ever could.
  </p>
  <p>
    I'm currently open to remote opportunities and relocation, particularly in AI Engineering,
    Data Science and Applied ML roles.
  </p>

  <GlowLineSeparator />

</Layout>
